## 2.4 Remove personal information from QR codes

Inspect the actual QR payload generation and worker lookup implementation.

Remove Aadhaar information, personal phone numbers, wage rates, outstanding balances and confidential work history from QR payloads.

The QR must encode only a suitable opaque reference or working application URL.

